Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:03:44 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] fix(reports): dynamically evaluate component DCRs in
 executive summary (DEF-08)

- Replace hardcoded unconditional "Pass" narrative with dynamic evaluation
- Evaluate DCRs across G1-G6 girders, cross-bracing, end-diaphragms, and deck slab
- Add _extract_osdag_efficiency_raw to parse nested and flat member result dicts
- Update Table 1 Overall Design Status to report Fail when any component fails (DCR > 1.0)
- Ensure narrative and summary table agree across all pass/fail states
- Verified across 74 synthetic boundary scenarios and authentic production pipeline snapshot

Accepted in Phase 3 Batch 1 audit P3-IA-001.
